S1: box rad 10px wid 1.55 ht 0.84 "1 Inspect" at (0, 0)
S2: box rad 10px wid 1.55 ht 0.84 "2 Select" at S1 + (2.15, 0)
S3: box rad 10px wid 1.55 ht 0.84 "3 Negotiate" at S2 + (2.15, 0)
S4: box rad 10px wid 1.55 ht 0.84 "4 Snapshot" at S3 + (0, -1.45)
S5: box rad 10px wid 1.55 ht 0.84 "5 Instantiate" at S4 + (-2.15, 0)
S6: box rad 10px wid 1.55 ht 0.84 "6 Resolve" at S5 + (-2.15, 0)
S7: box rad 10px wid 1.55 ht 0.84 "7 Validate" at S6 + (0, -1.45)
S8: box rad 10px wid 1.55 ht 0.84 "8 Act" at S7 + (2.15, 0)
S9: box rad 10px wid 1.55 ht 0.84 "9 Report" at S8 + (2.15, 0)
Refuse: box rad 10px wid 1.55 ht 0.7 "Refused here" at S2 + (0, 1.2)
arrow from S1.e to S2.w
arrow from S2.e to S3.w
arrow from S3.s to S4.n
arrow from S4.w to S5.e
arrow from S5.w to S6.e
arrow from S6.s to S7.n
arrow from S7.e to S8.w
arrow from S8.e to S9.w
arrow from S2.n to Refuse.s
